					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4641209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4641209,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4641210
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 4641210,
					"content": "#哦~！暗中守護蒙德的英雄就是{F#妳}{M#你}啊，我代表騎士團向{F#妳}{M#你}道謝。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4641211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍夫曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 4641211,
					"content": "唔…不用這麼鄭重啦…我、我們都不好意思了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4641212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4641212,
					"content": "#等等…不對。{F#妳}{M#你}們不是最近才來的旅行者嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4641213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍夫曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 4641213,
					"content": "#在{F#妳}{M#你}們來蒙德之前，暗夜英雄的傳說就已經流傳很久了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4641214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍夫曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 4641214,
					"content": "啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4641215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4641215,
					"content": "…為什麼要說這樣的謊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4641216,
						4641217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍夫曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 4641216,
					"content": "嗯…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4641218
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 4641218,
					"content": "#…唉，算了。我知道{F#妳}{M#你}們不會是什麼壞人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4641219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍夫曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 4641219,
					"content": "#不過關於「暗夜英雄」，希望{F#妳}{M#你}們能抽空來騎士團再聊一聊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4641220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍夫曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 4641220,
					"content": "有些話不方便在這裡講。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4641221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍夫曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 4641221,
					"content": "公務在身，那我先走了，二位請注意安全。",
